  to be.\nFirst table through the door gets a round on us\, no matter the s
 ize. 🍻 Plus\, you could win a jersey!\nGet there early. Lock in your sp
 ot. Let the atmosphere build.\nSunday mornings are better with proper foot
 ball and good people.\nWho is Toronto26?\nWe run Toronto’s top soccer wa
 tch parties\, building hype for 2026 while helping grow the city’s socce
 r culture. Through high-energy events and community collaborations\, we br
