 nt that connects supporters beyond the stadium by turning local pubs and c
 ommunity spaces into matchday hubs where football culture can thrive.\nBec
 ause the game isn’t only played on the pitch. It lives wherever fans gat
 her.\nToronto is a soccer city.\nwww.toronto26.com | info@toronto26.com | 
