 's iconic venue The Monarch Tavern. Acoustic and unamplified\, come see fl
 amenco at its purest\, most intense and most thrilling. Modelled off the f
 lamenco tablaos in Granada\, nestled into caves in the city's hillside\, t
 his is flamenco as it is performed in Spain: improvised and dynamic.\nTaki
 ng place the first Sunday of every month\, LA CUEVA showcases the city's m
 ost lauded and in-demand flamenco performers. Special guests from out of t
 own will also be featured throughout the series.\nLet everything else slip
