DESCRIPTION:Gather your friends and have the time of your life at a specia
 l slumber party screening of Dirty Dancing.\nIt was the summer of 1963\, a
 nd Baby (Jennifer Grey) is excited to join the Peace Corps in the fall\, a
 nd thinks she’ll never find a guy as great as her dad. While vacationing
  with her family at a Catskills resort\, Baby volunteers to fill in as the
  dance partner of the handsome resort instructor\, Johnny (Patrick Swayze)
 . Featuring swoon-worthy romance\, electric dance sequences\, and written 
 from a distinct feminine perspective by screen writer Eleanor Bergstein\, 
 Dirty Dancing is an all-time slumber party staple.\nEnjoy this timeless cl
 assic like you would in your tween years: dressed in pajamas\, making frie
 ndship bracelets\, and preceded by a pj fashion show.\nBest pjs will be aw
 arded a special prize!
