BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Traces & Echoes : CONTACT Photography Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260506T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260506T180000
UID:blogto-234351@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/29/original_image0e3fb9ec-6555-4967-b41f-213d1ca457
 69.jpg
DESCRIPTION:May 6 – 23\nWed – Sun\, Noon-6pm\nOpening Reception Thurs 
 May 7\, 6pm-9pm\nBeaver Hall Gallery\n29 McCaul St. Toronto\, ON\nPart of 
 the CONTACT Photography festival 2026\nTraces & Echoes is a photography-ba
 sed installation by Michelle Breslin and Barbara Greczny exploring landsca
 pe as a site of memory\, reflection\, and emotional resonance. Through pho
 tography\, video\, sound\, and installation\, the artists present Ontario
 ’s forests\, roadsides\, and open skies as spaces where personal histori
 es quietly surface.\nIndependently created yet aligned\, their photographi
 c works reveal unexpected visual harmonies when shown together. Video elem
 ents draw viewers into a contemplative journey through the province’s co
 untryside\, while a subtle soundscape invites pause and attentiveness. Roo
 ted in lived experience\, Traces & Echoes reflects on loss\, connection\, 
 and the restorative presence of the natural world.
LOCATION:Beaver Hall Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/traces-echoes-contact-photography-festiv
 al-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
