BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Before Borders
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260507T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260507T210000
UID:blogto-233997@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/22/original_image21372111-3a3b-467f-a248-6be1282c92
 7b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Twist Gallery and Dreams Tree Community Investments and photog
 raphy by Ryan Bolton and Yuma Dean Hester!\nWith no fixed itinerary\, we t
 raveled north through Northern Alberta into the Rockies. We then ventured 
 into the Yukon and the Northwest Territories in pursuit of the Northern Li
 ghts. What began as a road trip became an exercise in listening and being 
 present.\nAlong the way\, we met with Elders\, Chiefs\, and storytellers w
 hose histories are inseparable from the land. Conversations about memory\,
  responsibility\, and continuity — reminders that these landscapes are n
 ot empty expanses\, but living territories shaped by generations of knowle
 dge and care.\nBefore Borders reflects on what it means to cross provincia
 l lines while recognizing deeper\, enduring boundaries that predate them. 
 The work considers travel not as an escape\, but as an exchange — guided
  by those who have called this land home since time immemorial.
LOCATION:Twist Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/before-borders-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
