 78.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The debut of a new play by actor/playwright Kenzie Delo.\nSyno
 psis:\nOn the deck of a ship stands ‘The Atlantean\,’ a single-seat su
 bmersible designed to withstand the deepest reaches of Earth’s oceans. N
 ext to it stands Levin\, whose dream of a research mission to the bottom o
 f the ocean has become a reality in spite of questions surrounding his sci
 entific views. The deeper he goes\, and the darker it gets\, the more dire
  his dive becomes\, and the surer he gets that he is being stalked by some
 thing just out of sight…\nA story of wonder\, fear\, and romance\, 'Here
  Be Dragons' tracks a scientist’s descent into a world where he will eit
 her shed light on one of the world’s last great mysteries\, or become a 
 part of it.\nTickets can be found at: https://theatrecentre.org/event/here
 -be-dragons/\nPerformance dates and times:\nMay 7th 7:30PM\nMay 8th 7:30PM
 \nMay 9th 2:00PM and 7:30PM\nMay 10th 2:00PM
