BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Night of Hard Dance Masters - IMHAPPY [ES]\, BROKEN MINDS [ES]
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260508T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260509T033000
UID:blogto-234426@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/30/original_image7fcaeb77-407b-45d0-bd95-612b0b01fe
 79.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Friday May 8 2026\nHARD DANCE DOUBLE HEADLINER MAY MADNESS!\nE
 MBRYON EVENTS proudly presents for their first time ever in CANADA...\n
 🚨 IMHAPPY [Spain]\n🚨BROKEN MINDS [Spain]\nAlongside hard hitting loc
 als:\nOUTERKULT - hard techno / industrial / schranz\nA_C_E - hard techno 
 / schranz\nB7 - gabber / industrial hardcore / darkcore\n➡️ IMHAPPY is
  a high-energy\, hard dance electronic music producer and DJ\, based in Sp
 ain\, making serious waves in the hard techno scenes. With huge collaborat
 ions alongside artists like Unicorn on K\, The Dark Horror\, Anime\, and h
 aving released edits and remixes of massive tunes\, an IMHAPPY set is basi
 cally a masterclass in high-BPM mastery. He's packing relentless energy an
 d leaning hard into the hard bounce of the dancefloor! Known for a relentl
 ess mix of hard techno fused with rave stabs and harder dance kicks\, IMHA
 PPY doesn't just play a set—they stake their presence on the dancefloor 
 and go on a fun\, wild romp on the dancefloor!\nWith chart-topping hits li
 ke "Dark Smile"\, the viral anthem "Atlantis"\, and a Spanish version of t
 he Holy Priest remix of Vielleicht Vielleicht\,  IMHAPPY has become a glob
 al force in the high-BPM world. If you’ve heard the "Hard Bounce" sound 
 taking over festivals\, you know exactly what’s coming: distorted kicks\
 , piercing synths\, and energy that doesn't quit until the lights come up.
  Expect lots of unreleased edits\, remixes and high bpms! He can play supe
 r fun\, a bit silly\, super serious and everything in between. He's blowin
 g up huge\, so see him before he's packing arenas!\n➡️ BROKEN MINDS\nT
 rue kings of the Spanish hard dance world specializing in music that blend
 s epic\, euphoric melodies with devastatingly heavy kicks. We tried t find
  a few tracks we consider indispensable by them and came up with over 40 t
 racks. BROKEN MINDS is a powerhouse of talent and catchy tunes!\nFrom melo
 dic to raw power with industrial sized kicks\, they're not afraid to go in
 to zaags\, pieps\, raw or gabber kicks. Whatever gets them the most broken
  minds on the dancefloor! Their Creepy Terror Show album was a perfect ble
 nd of their style with collabs with Korsakoff\, Anime\, Nosferatu\, D-Frek
 \, Tha Playah\, Nolz\, Lea Konig\, Irradiate\, Anime\, Ender\, Tha Watcher
 \, Alee\, Malice\, Furyan and that's just one disc! They've also collabora
 ted or remixed Dr. Peacock\, Re-Style\, The Satan\, Ophidian\, Promo\, OMI
 \, and more!\nSigned to the legendary Masters of Hardcore stable\, Broken 
 Minds have played among the biggest stages on the planet for hard dance in
 cluding Thunderdome\, Defqon.1\, Masters of Hardcore\, Dominator\, Fabrik 
 and more.\nThis is a DO NOT MISS event for those that live hard dance. If 
 you've been to Holy Priest\, Lil Texas\, TeletechUK\, Joost\, Restricted\,
  Sara Landry or Nikolina recently\, this show is for you!\nøøø hard tec
 hno ø hardcore ø raw ø uptempo ø schranz ø industrial hardcore øøø
 \n▶▶▶Merch available at the show as well including hoodies. If you w
 ant something reserved in advance\, drop us a line.\n▶ We sell tickets b
 elow the cost of producing our shows because we believe everyone should be
  able to afford to come. We encourage you to purchase the ticket that best
  suits your budget and financial needs.\n▶ BALLER TICKETS are for those 
 in the community that are in a position to further support our events & su
 bsidize those that need some financial help. We thank you & the community 
 thanks you. You should feel good about purchasing at this price point if y
 ou're in a position to do so. We thank you for your generous support.\nVen
 ue info to be sent to all ticket holders\nFollow us at https://www.instagr
 am.com/embryonevents/
LOCATION:333 Yonge St
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-night-of-hard-dance-masters-imhappy-es
 -broken-minds-es-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
