 46.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This immersive guided tasting experience explores the iconic N
 egroni and its bold\, bittersweet profile. Each ticket includes a Classic 
 Negroni\, three Negroni Family Tree variations\, and a curated food pairin
 g from Executive Chef Nick Liu’s savoury dumpling menu\, along with a Ca
 mpari keepsake.\nDesigned to demystify bitterness and highlight the simpli
 city at the heart of the Negroni\, this experience is perfect for both coc
 ktail enthusiasts and those looking to explore aperitivo culture.\nTax and
  gratuity are included in the ticket price.
