ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/22/original_imagea605108c-9592-4108-bd2b-3112e337c0
 0a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:🎶 Etobicoke Philharmonic Orchestra Presents: Beethoven Reim
 agined\nExperience classical music like you’ve never seen it before.\nTh
 e Etobicoke Philharmonic Orchestra closes its season with a bold and immer
 sive program that brings together music\, technology\, and powerful storyt
 elling.\nAt the heart of the concert is a groundbreaking collaboration wit
 h Humber Polytechnic\, reimagining Beethoven’s Symphony No. 6 (Pastoral)
  through stunning real-time digital visuals. This innovative performance t
 ransforms Beethoven’s celebration of nature into a fully immersive audio
 visual experience.\nThe program also features guest soloist Luke Welch per
 forming the rediscovered Piano Concerto in One Movement by Florence Price
 —a powerful and expressive work blending Romantic lyricism with African 
 American spiritual and rhythmic influences.\n📅 Concert Dates & Location
 s\nFriday\, May 8 – 8:00 PM\n📍 Martingrove Collegiate Institute\n50 W
 interton Drive\, Etobicoke\nSaturday\, May 9 – 2:00 PM\n📍 Humber Cult
 ural Hub Recital Hall\n3199 Lake Shore Blvd W\, Etobicoke
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/beethoven-reimagined-a-stunning-audiovis
 ual-concert-experience-in-toronto-toronto/
