 ndent record store\, Sonic Boom has spent the past 25 years dedicated to m
 usic\, fostering the local community\, and filling your shelves with your 
 favourite records. With specially curated visuals and a unique historic sp
 ace open to all ages\, this mini-fest will kick off an early start to summ
 er. Come celebrate this 25 year milestone together with Sonic Boom\, Toron
 to’s Record Store.\nFEATURING\nThe Sadies (Toronto // Dine Alone Records
