 s // hazy melancholy rock storytellers)\nBadge Époque Ensemble (Toronto /
 / expert cosmic-jazz collaborators)\nRoach (Toronto // indie reverb devote
 es)\nThe Get Alongs (Toronto // high-energy garage rockers)\nPaste (Toront
 o // anthemic power-pop)\nSun Parker (South Frontenac // archival ambience
 )\n+ special guests
