 dent podcasters\, digital creators\, and audio storytellers who want to gr
 ow their craft\, brand\, and business.\nJoin us on Saturday\, May 9\, 2026
 \, at Harbourfront Centre in Toronto for a full day of conversations\, lea
 rning\, and connection focused on the art\, business\, and the future of a
 udio / video storytelling.\nAttendees will hear from industry professional
 s\, connect with creators and podcast teams\, and leave with practical ins
 ights they can apply to their own work.\nParticipating teams include The S
 onar Network\, Lead Podcasting\, Black Canadian Creators\, Women in Media\
 , and Canadaland\, with more speakers and partners.\nTicket info available
  at thesoundwavesummit.com
