 s you to Tulip Day!\n\nThis year\, the Consulate will be giving out 15\,00
 0 tulips as a living symbol of the Netherlands’ enduring gratitude to\, 
 and ongoing friendship with\, Canada.\nJoin us in marking the anniversary 
 of the liberation of the Netherlands\, a victory that was secured through 
 the courage\, sacrifice\, and dedicated efforts of Canadian men and women 
 during the Second World War. It’s also a chance to celebrate Dutch Herit
 age Month in Ontario!\nNo registration or entry fee required.\nTulips are 
 available on a first-come first-served basis\, so arrive early to make sur
 e you get yours!
