 e St\nStep into a new era of nightlife inside one of Toronto’s most icon
 ic spaces — the former home of the legendary HMV Superstore.\nFor one ni
 ght\, we’re turning it into a full-scale video dance experience where th
 e biggest hits of the 90s and 2000s go head-to-head.\n🎥 Screens playing
  original music videos\n🔊 Wall-of-sound audio system\n🌈 Immersive li
 ghting + visuals\n🕺 Non-stop singalong anthems\n💿 What to Expect\nTh
 is isn’t just a party — it’s a time machine.\nJump between eras as D
 Js spin the tracks that defined generations:\n90s Pop\, Hip-Hop & R&B\nY2K
  Club Anthems & Dancefloor Classics\nRock\, Throwback EDM\, and crossover 
 hits\nThe songs you forgot you loved… and still know every word to\nFrom
  Backstreet Boys to Britney\, Usher to Outkast\, Blink-182 to Avril\, Daft
  Punk to early 2000s bangers — it’s all here.\n🎤 The Vibe\nSing at 
 the top of your lungs\nDance like it’s your first club night ever\nReliv
 e memories or discover the era for the first time\nCome with your crew —
  leave with new ones\nWhether you're team 90s nostalgia or Y2K energy\, th
 is is your new monthly destination.\n$5 in advance - $10 at door.  19+ eve
 nt.  No Dress Code.
LOCATION:Raven
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/y2k-vs-90s-video-dance-party-toronto/
