 gto.com/events/2026/04/30/original_imaged839cb09-19b6-4f2f-9903-0e90a06f2a
 10.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother's Day with a flavourful afternoon at Bangkok 
 Garden!\nOn Sunday\, May 10\, Bangkok Garden will be serving a festive lun
 ch buffet\, prepared especially for the occasion.\nFor one day only\, our 
 lunch buffet takes on a special twist – a Mother’s Day edition of our 
 Unlimited Tasting Menu usually reserved for weekdays\, now expanded with e
 ven more variety to explore. Guests can enjoy a vibrant spread of Thai fav
 ourites\, from signature appetizers like the Thai Wings to aromatic mains 
 alongside our beloved Bangkok street-style noodle bar\, and a selection of
  desserts to end on a sweet note.\nWith gluten-free\, vegan\, and vegetari
 an options available\, this experience offers a great opportunity to savou
 r a variety of mouthwatering flavours\, spend time together\, and make the
  occasion feel special for mom.\nWHEN: Sunday\, May 10 from 11:30 am to 3 
 pm\nPRICE: $33.95 per person* | Children (aged 6-10) – $16.98 per child 
 | Children (5 & under) – Free – one complimentary meal per adult meal 
 purchased.\nRESERVATIONS:  Guests can book reservations either by phone 
 or through the Bangkok Garden website. For groups of 6 or more\, guests mu
 st call to book.\nPlease note that lunch reservations will be required for
  the event and should be secured with a credit card.\nPhone number: 416-97
 7-6748\nFor online reservations: https://bangkokgarden.ca/restaurant-speci
 als-toronto/\nView menu here: https://bangkokgarden.ca/mothers-day-2026/\n
 *Dine-in only. Excludes taxes and gratuities. Cannot be combined with any 
 other offers\, discounts\, or dinner cards. Does not include beverages or 
 alcohol.
LOCATION:Bangkok Garden
