BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:El Clasico Watch Party: Real Madrid vs Barcelona
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260510T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260510T173000
UID:blogto-234472@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/01/original_image4068a131-5670-4106-960f-f74c07cf7d
 d7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:FREE TO ATTEND! ⚽\nOn Sunday\, May 10 @ 2:30 PM\, Toronto26 
 is bringing El Clásico — Real Madrid vs Barcelona — to Oche King West
  for the biggest match in club football. 🏟️🔥\nTwo of the world's g
 reatest clubs. One afternoon that delivers every time. Madrid and Barça k
 now what's on the line... and so do we. 🔴🔵⚪\nToronto's biggest El 
 Clásico watch party. Madridistas and Culés both welcome. If you bleed wh
 ite or blaugrana\, this is your home on May 10. 🏙️\nBig screens. The 
 energy you'd expect from El Clásico. And happy hour running all afternoon
  — $9 cocktails\, house wine & beer\, plus 2 pizzas for $30. 🍕🍻\nF
 irst table through the door gets a round on us (up to 4 people). 🍻 Plus
 \, you could win a Real or Barça jersey!\nWhether you're Madridista or Cu
 lé — or just there for the spectacle — this is where you want to be.\
 nDoors open early\, so get there ahead of kickoff and lock in your spot. L
 et the atmosphere build.\nSunday afternoons don't get bigger than this. 
 🌟\nWho is Toronto26?\nWe run Toronto’s top soccer watch parties\, bui
 lding hype for 2026 while helping grow the city’s soccer culture. Throug
 h high-energy events and community collaborations\, we bring fans\, local 
 businesses\, and neighbourhoods together around the game.\nToronto26 is al
 so part of the Matchday Social network\, a growing movement that connects 
 supporters beyond the stadium by turning local pubs and community spaces i
 nto matchday hubs where football culture can thrive.\nBecause the game isn
 ’t only played on the pitch. It lives wherever fans gather.\nToronto is 
 a soccer city.\nwww.toronto26.com | info@toronto26.com | info@matchdaysoci
 al.com | #TorontoIsASoccerCity\n* Independent watch party. Not affiliated 
 with or endorsed by Real Madrid\, Barcelona\, or the league.
LOCATION:Oche King West
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/el-clasico-watch-party-real-madrid-vs-ba
 rcelona-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
