 beginner-friendly yoga flow.\nThis class blends relaxation\, mindfulness\,
  and light movement with joyful kitten interaction—creating a soothing a
 nd uplifting atmosphere for all levels. Expect moments of stillness\, smil
 es\, and plenty of heartwarming connection.\nPerfect for anyone looking to
  de-stress\, recharge\, and enjoy a little extra purring happiness 🐾✨
LOCATION:539a Mount Pleasant
