 Streep)\, who enchanted them years ago. Hilarity and Swedish pop music ens
 ue!\nBefore the party begins\, join music director\, Doug Price for a harm
 ony lesson from one of the film’s most iconic songs.\nSo put on your bes
 t ’70s fashions and warm up your lungs because it’s going to be an ABB
 A-tastic evening!
