 e\, Deadline is an improvised journalism mini-thriller. Gasp\, laugh\, and
  shake your heads as the reporters of a failing newspaper follow what seem
 s to be a simple story through the halls of power to reveal just how rotte
 n the system is. Navigating politics\, budget cuts\, and their personal st
 ruggles to get ink to page\, some of the city's best improvisers craft a s
 tory right before your eyes... and before the deadline.\nCast: Joshua Brow
 ne\, Cecilia Serafina\, and SPECIAL GUESTS!\nPLURIBYES\nWe just want to ma
 ke you laugh\nWe are one.\nWe have a biological imperative.\nMake. You. La
 ugh.\nCast:\nAlex Kubix\nMihnea Galeteanu\nJanek Gonsalkorale\nFrank Nicol
 son\nGreg Kozma\nFernando Nogueira\nSam Needham
