 . He brings his unique artistry to the North American Première of Jessie 
 Montgomery’s powerful new Cello Concerto. The evening then soars into my
 thic realms with the haunting legend of The Flying Dutchman and the sweepi
 ng grandeur of Götterdämmerung—a tale of betrayal\, love\, sacrifice\,
  and the twilight of the gods.
