BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sattalites and DJ Jay NuFunk Reggae Night at Hughs Room Live
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T000000
UID:blogto-234534@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/02/original_imagec8ca6673-2d8c-4889-80b5-ce2374fc9e
 39.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Sattalites are now known as one of the longest-running and
  most successful reggae groups in Canada.\nCatch them live in an intimate 
 setting at Hugh’s Room Live on Fri May 15\, 2026. Expect a vibrant mix o
 f original hits and classic Jamaican favourites from a band whose roots tr
 ace back to Toronto’s Little Jamaica in the early ’80s—evolving from
  a community music school into a JUNO Award-winning reggae institution wit
 h international touring acclaim.\nWith DJ Jay NuFunk spinning all vinyl cl
 assic reggae\, the night delivers a deep\, authentic throwback vibe from s
 tart to finish.\nFounded in Toronto in 1981\, The Sattalites grew out of a
  “pay-what-you-can” music school in Little Jamaica led by Jo Jo Bennet
 t and Fergus Hambleton. Known for blending deep reggae roots with strong p
 op harmonies\, they quickly built a reputation for energetic live shows. T
 heir 1985 debut album featuring “Wild” propelled them to international
  touring and earned them JUNO Awards in 1990 and 1993\, cementing their le
 gacy in Canadian reggae history.\nJay NuFunk\nJay “NuFunk” Cleary is a
  Toronto-based DJ\, promoter\, and vinyl collector\, and a founder behind 
 NuFunk Concerts\, Make It Funky\, and Groovin in the Park. He has performe
 d across Canada\, United States\, and Jamaica\, sharing stages with artist
 s like UB40\, Femi Kuti\, and Stephen Marley. Also known as a skilled guit
 arist\, Jay currently plays with roots-reggae outfit @Reggaddiction\, brin
 ging a deep musicality to his genre-spanning DJ sets rooted in reggae\, du
 b & dancehall.\n#ReggaeNight #TheSattalites #TorontoEvents #TorontoReggae 
 #LiveMusicTO
LOCATION:Hugh's Room
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-sattalites-and-dj-jay-nufunk-reggae-
 night-at-hughs-room-live-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
