 4c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:May is Cystic Fibrosis Awareness month. Supporting the efforts
  and advocacy of Cystic Fibrosis Canada is a cause that is very close to o
 ur hearts at The Fox.  All proceeds from this screening will support our t
 eam’s fundraising efforts at the 21st Walk to Make CF History on May 31s
 t!\nPerfect for audiences of all ages\, Ponyo centres on the friendship be
 tween five-year-old Sosuke and a magical goldfish named Ponyo\, the young 
 daughter of a sorcerer father and a sea-goddess mother. After a chance enc
 ounter\, Ponyo yearns to become a human so she can be with Sosuke.\nAs to 
 be expected with Miyazaki\, the film is awash in pure unbridled imaginatio
 n and visual wonder — but it is the tender love\, humour\, and devotion 
 exhibited by Ponyo and Sosuke that form the emotional heart of the film.\n
 Note: the following screenings will be dubbed in English.\nThank you to GK
 IDS Films for this screening!
LOCATION:Fox Theatre
