SUMMARY:Goon Squad & Sexies
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T223000
UID:blogto-233600@blogto.com
DESCRIPTION:GOON SQUAD\nThey weren’t born evil. They were hired.\nBefore
  the explosions\, the lairs\, and the dramatic monologues… someone had t
 o answer the job posting. GOON SQUAD is a fully improvised movie about the
  nameless henchmen behind every great villain — how they met\, why they 
 stayed\, and the extremely questionable life choices that led them to a ca
 reer in disposable evil.\nWe open on a high-stakes moment that throws this
  unlikely crew together (inspired by a suggestion from the audience). Then
  we rewind. Through flashbacks\, side missions\, and very bad interviews\,
  we uncover the origin stories of each goon — the friendships\, betrayal
 s\, and HR violations that shaped them into “Guy With Gun #3.”\nEvery 
 twist\, explosion\, and dramatic reveal is made up on the spot\, as the st
 ory races back to the opening moment… where everything finally makes ter
 rible\, hilarious sense.\nCast: Simon Pond\, Lance Oribello\, JJ Greenberg
 \, Maria Besko\, Jared Wonago\, Elanja Corosky\, Brandon Craggs
LOCATION:Videocabaret\, Deanne Taylor
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/goon-squad-sexies-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
