BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hip-Hop Soundbath with Born I
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T210000
UID:blogto-234100@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/23/original_image9df648ed-cf52-4c4f-b3d7-cb61a9d037
 7f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Guided Meditation. Crystal Bowl Soundbath. LoFi Hip Hop.\nTrea
 t yourself to an immersive evening of musical meditation goodness with Bor
 n I (aka Ofosu Jones-Quartey)\, a meditation teacher\, hip-hop artist and 
 author from the Washington DC area. Performing under the name Born I\, his
  music and meditation experiences are a fusion of guided meditation\, soun
 dbath and lyricism. Bathe yourself kindness and compassion by taking in th
 ese sweet sounds of self love.\nNo prior experience necessary. You Are Eno
 ugh.\nHosted by The Consciousness Explorers Club\, tickets for this event 
 are offered on a sliding scale. Please select the option that best fits yo
 ur financial situation. Pay what you can tickets will be available at the 
 door!\nMore about Born I\nHailing from the Washington DC area\, Born I is 
 an artist holding space at the intersection of Hip Hop and Mindfulness. He
  is the male voice on the popular meditation app Balance\, and he leads mi
 ndfulness retreats across the country\, using an emphasis on self-compassi
 on and his music as a method of teaching.\nHis latest albums "Komorebi" an
 d “AMIDA” are expressions of Hip Hop as a form of meditation. His late
 st book\, Lyrical Dharma - Hip-Hop as Mindfulness was released in 2025. Hi
 s vision of bringing the worlds of Hip Hop and Mindfulness together expand
 s the potential of both music and wellness\, now and in the future.\n“I 
 want to create music and experiences for people to understand that it’s 
 ok to be exactly who you are. You are enough.” – Born I
LOCATION:Friends House Toronto
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/hip-hop-soundbath-with-born-i-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
