 gto.com/events/2025/12/15/original_image029f3347-2aa2-49c0-83a6-18e7e7c48f
 f9.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Sooshi Mango are one of Australia’s most successful and belo
 ved comedy acts\, created by brothers Joe and Carlo Salanitri and their cl
 ose friend Andrew Manfre.\nWhat began just nine years ago as casual\, car-
 filmed comedy clips quickly grew into a cultural phenomenon. Their relatab
 le\, character-driven humour—rooted in the experiences of immigrant fami
 lies—has earned them record-breaking live shows\, viral global reach\, a
 nd a devoted audience across Australia and beyond.\nDon’t miss your chan
 ce to see Sooshi Mango live—the world tour is coming.\nTickets available
  @ https://eventschaser.com/sooshi-mango/
