 gto.com/events/2026/04/23/original_imagee917eb95-9c52-451b-a004-ba25064027
 22.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join TIFA for this exclusive event with the multi-million best
 -selling author\, Louise Penny\, and writer and journalist\, Mellissa Fung
 \, as they launch their new novel\, The Last Mandarin. This fast-paced\, a
 ll-too-real thriller features an estranged mother and daughter caught in a
  global reckoning where family\, loyalty\, and power collide. It is an ele
 ctrifying study of absolute power and voracious greed\, as well as an inti
 mate examination of choice\, of sacrifice\, of memory and myths. The co-au
 thors will be in conversation with Jared Bland to share their journey as p
 artners in crime writing\, and the personal and political influences that 
 shaped their debut novel together.\nTicket prices start at $39.\nTIFA Pres
 ents is generously supported by Presenting Donors Beth Nowers and Jack Cur
 tin
