BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Resin on Canvas Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260517T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260517T200000
UID:blogto-234064@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/22/original_image3fc47c35-4b25-4bc5-ba78-5f02cbccd5
 8c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Mix and pour your art at this vibrant resin art experience\, w
 here you’ll create a stunning resin masterpiece on canvas with your own 
 personal flair.\nWhat to Expect:\nExplore the beauty of resin as you desig
 n your canvas using a wide variety of dyes\, pigments\, crystals\, gold/si
 lver leaf\, glitters\, metallic flakes\, and other embellishments.\nThe fi
 rst hour will be dedicated to planning and designing your composition. You
 ’ll then mix\, pour\, and layer your resin to bring your artwork to life
  with beautiful\, fluid effects.\nCreative Techniques:\nLearn how to prope
 rly measure\, mix\, tint\, and pour resin onto canvas. Our instructor will
  guide you through layering techniques\, movement methods\, and how to ach
 ieve depth\, shimmer\, and dimension.\nAll materials are included:\nProfes
 sional-grade resin\nCanvas\nPigments and decorative elements\, including g
 old/silver leaf and glass crystals\nGloves\, a respirator mask\, and prote
 ctive equipment\nTools and supplies needed for your project\nParticipants 
 are welcome to bring small\, lightweight mementos (such as photos or senti
 mental items) to incorporate into their art.\nSnacks & Refreshments: Compl
 imentary tea\, coffee\, water\, and light snacks will be available.\nWho S
 hould Join: Open to ages 12+. No experience necessary.\n(Participants unde
 r 16 must be accompanied by at least one paying adult.)\nCuring & Pickup:\
 nYour canvas is best to remain at the studio to cure properly. Pieces will
  be ready for pickup the following weekend to allow for full curing and fi
 nishing. If pickup isn't possible\, participants can receive a to-go box a
 t their own risk\, or shipping is available for an additional fee based on
  location.\nResin Workshop Disclaimer:\nResin is a sensitive medium that r
 equires careful attention to detail. It is very important to listen closel
 y and follow all instructions to ensure the success of your artwork. Impro
 per mixing or missed steps may result in pieces that do not cure properly.
 \nIf adjustments are needed\, our team can assist with repairs for a small
  fee\, or you may attend another workshop at a discounted rate to recreate
  your piece or add an additional resin layer after your artwork has cured.
 \nSpaces are limited — reserve your spot today.\nSee more events at: htt
 ps://www.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at: 647-617-9550
LOCATION:Artbox Studio Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-resin-on-canvas-workshop-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
