 fd.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a guided oil painting workshop where you’ll expl
 ore the rich colour\, softness\, and depth of oil paint.\nWhat to Expect:\
 nPerfect for both beginners and those refining their practice\, this works
 hop guides you step-by-step through sketching\, layering\, blending\, and 
 building highlights and shadows to create realism and vibrancy. You’ll l
 earn time-honoured oil painting techniques with supportive guidance throug
 hout.\nGuided Instruction:\nLearn foundational oil painting methods from a
 n experienced artist—from initial sketch to final detail work—using la
 yering\, glazing\, and observation of light.\nCreative Freedom: Customize 
 your painting with your own tones\, brushwork style\, and level of realism
  or looseness.\nAll Materials Included: High-quality oil paints\, brushes\
 , palette knives\, apron\, stretched canvas\, to-go box\, and all other ne
 cessary supplies are included.\nRelaxed Studio Atmosphere: Enjoy a relaxed
 \, inspiring space with soft music and uplifting creative energy.\nSnacks 
 & Refreshments: Complimentary coffee\, tea\, water and snacks available th
 roughout.\nWho Should Join:\nSuitable for beginners and intermediate artis
 ts.\nMust be ages 12+. Participants under 18 must be accompanied by a payi
 ng 18+ adult.\nLimited spots available — reserve your canvas today.\nSee
  more events at: https://www.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at:
  647-617-9550
