 o left a career as a Microsoft software engineer to pursue comedy full-tim
 e. He is a recurring guest performer on the Howard Stern Show and the co f
 ounder of the internationally touring Tech Roast Show. Known for his tech-
 savvy humor and impeccable impressions\, Austin has amassed a following of
