 fd.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Discover adventure like never before—right here at your Toro
 nto Zoo!\nJoin us for an exclusive evening featuring films from the Elora 
 Adventure Film Festival. Experience breathtaking stories of exploration\, 
 resilience\, and the natural world paired with a relaxed\, after-hours atm
 osphere at your Toronto Zoo.\nIt is with great excitement that Ian Evans\,
  founder of the festival\, will be joining us to share insights from his j
 ourney filming adventure stories and bringing these powerful experiences t
 o life.\nIt is the perfect night out! Immerse yourself in inspiring storyt
 elling\, connect with fellow adventure enthusiasts\, and enjoy your Toront
 o Zoo in a whole new way.\nDon’t miss this unique experience! Secure you
 r tickets today!
