 gto.com/events/2026/04/08/original_image1cacdb3c-114f-4f77-aca1-2399141952
 58.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Sat May 23: CJ JEFF [Greece]\nBarroness | Shannon Young | Cozm
 ic Cat\nGet ready\, Toronto… this one’s special.\nInternational house 
 heavyweight CJ JEFF makes his Wiggle Room debut\, bringing his signature h
 igh-energy bouncy grooves and deep\, driving rhythms to the dancefloor for
  the very first time. Known for rocking clubs and festivals across the glo
 be\, CJ Jeff delivers a sound that’s both powerful and infectious—buil
 t to keep you moving all night long.\nAdvance Tickets:\nEarly Wiggler: $20
 \nThe Wiggler: $25\nPerformances:\n10-12  Shannon Young\n12-1:30  Cozmic C
 at\n1:30-4 CJ JEFF\n4-close  Barroness\nVJ SEKS\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the
  #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket
  = everything mentioned):\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nincludes: 3 General Adm
 issions\; 1 Bottle of (BG) Vodka on Special\n2) Regular Package: $700\ninc
 ludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (may email wiggl
 yevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n3) Premium Package: $900\nincludes: 
 6 General Admissions\; 2 Premium Bottles of Choice (email wigglyevents@gma
 il.com to specify choice)\nTo Arrange Special Packages - wigglyevents@gmai
 l.com (sold separately from admission)\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n21+
  event\nhosted by:  Sunshine Frequencies\; Wiggly Events\; and Wiggle Room
  Toronto\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and res
 erve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance 
 Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate 
 to bring to our attention anything you think that we should be made aware 
 of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal space\, solicitation or us
 e of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything else
  that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or others. You may use the safe
  word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct you 
 to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are in marked clothing. Our te
 am and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Nour Bawab\, Christina 
 Barron\, Tyler Hill\, Monique\, and Tanya\, are all available.\n~ Wiggle W
 iggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
LOCATION:Wiggle Room
