 gto.com/events/2026/04/10/original_imagec2b4e6e5-ceeb-41d2-86d4-8998b31697
 ed.jpg
DESCRIPTION:THE BOX OFFICE IS NOW OPEN FOR RYTHMES EN FOLIE!\nA true pilla
 r of the Franco-Torontonian cultural scene for over thirty years\, the voc
 al ensemble Les voix du cœur is proud to announce its major end-of-season
  show: Rythmes en Folie. True to its reputation for contagious energy and 
 overflowing creativity\, the ensemble invites the public to a festive cele
 bration where the voice becomes the engine of a musical exploration withou
 t borders.\nAn Immersion in Sound Diversity\nThe show Rythmes en Folie off
 ers a bold journey through a vast mosaic of musical styles. From local son
 gs to rhythms from abroad\, the choir members will passionately perform a 
 repertoire carefully chosen to resonate with the heart of the Francophone 
 and Francophile community.\nExclusive Pre-sale Offer (Assigned seating –
  Seating chart available online)\nPre-sale Rates (until April 26): $25 or 
 a 4-ticket package for $80\nRegular Rate (starting April 27): $30 At the D
 oor: $35\nAges 6 to 18: $15 Ages 0 to 5: Free
LOCATION:Jane Mallett Theatre\, St. Lawrence Centre for the Arts
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/les-voix-du-coeur-presents-rythmes-en-fo
 lie-toronto/
