  beauty of resin as you add layers of colours\, gold leaf\, pressed floral
 s and other embellishments. With guided instruction\, you’ll learn how t
 o mix\, tint\, pour\, and layer resin to create pieces unique to you.\nWha
 t’s Included:\n• Creation of two or more resin pendants or earrings\n
 • Choice to finish pieces as earrings\, necklaces\, or both\n• Guided 
 instruction on resin mixing\, pouring\, and layering techniques\n• All r
 esin\, tools\, gloves\, masks\, pendant frames\, embellishments\, and jewe
 lry hardware (chains\, hooks\, jump rings)\n• Cozy studio vibe with musi
 c and creative freedom\n• Complimentary coffee\, tea\, and snacks\nTake 
 It Home:\nYour finished jewelry will be ready to take home the same day—
 perfect to wear or gift.\nWho Can Attend:\nOpen to ages 12+. No experience
  needed. Participants under 16 must attend with at least one paying adult.
 \nSpaces are limited—join us for a creative jewelry-making experience at
  Artbox and leave wearing your own art.\nNo experience needed!\nSee more e
 vents at: https://www.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at: 647-61
 7-9550
