 op.\nWhat to Expect:\nLearn how to handcraft luxurious\, all-natural self-
 care products using premium ingredients\, herbs\, and essential oils.\nSet
 tle into our warm\, inspiring 2-level gallery\, enjoy a tea\, infused wate
 r and a snack\, as our instructor guides you step by step through creating
  your own spa collection. You’ll explore scent blending\, natural ingred
 ient benefits\, and safe mixing techniques while crafting products designe
 d to nourish the body and calm the mind. Personalize your creations by sel
 ecting your favourite scents\, botanicals\, and finishing touches.\nWhat
 ’s Included:\n• Materials to create a handcrafted soy candle\n• Prem
 ium Ingredients to create a rich\, moisturizing whipped body butter\n• I
 ngredients to make a natural exfoliating body scrub\n• Herbs and botanic
 als to blend a soothing oatmeal bath tea\n• Step-by-step instruction fro
 m an experienced instructor\n• All materials and supplies provided\n• 
 Complimentary snacks\, tea\, coffee\, and refreshments\nBy the end of the 
 workshop\, you’ll take home a beautiful collection of handmade spa essen
 tials—perfect for personal self-care or thoughtful gifting.\nWho Should 
 Attend:\nIdeal for anyone seeking some self-care and a creative\, hands-on
