BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Baroque Music and Fashion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T203000
UID:blogto-234463@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/30/original_imagee824c329-d1d3-490c-a10e-53367d7292
 5a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy chamber music of Baroque composers and learn many intere
 sting facts about fashion\, makeup and wigs.\nThis event offers more than 
 a concert—it’s an immersive journey into the Baroque era. The audience
  will enjoy exquisite music by Baroque composers while simultaneously disc
 overing fascinating insights into the world of historical fashion: elabora
 te wigs\, ornate footwear\, beauty marks\, and the artistry of period make
 up.\nWhat makes it especially engaging is that the performers themselves w
 ill appear in authentic period costumes\, bringing the era vividly to life
 !\nThe program features a unique combination of organ\, flute\, soprano an
 d piano\, enriched by engaging commentary and elegant Minuet choreography 
 that brings the spirit of the Baroque era to life.\nWe invite the audience
  to take a trip into the distant past\, 400 years ago\, to the 16th-17th c
 enturies. It was at this time that a style called “Baroque” appeared.\
 nThe program includes music of Bach\, Vivaldi\, Rameau and Scarlatti and m
 ore... with Holly Chaplin (soprano)\, Dmitriy Varelas (flute)\, Maya Vasse
 rman (piano)\, Alina Grunina (guitar)\, Yulia Varelas (organ/piano)\, Alys
 on Guan (piano)
LOCATION:Lawrence Park Community Church
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/baroque-music-and-fashion-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
