BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Glenn Paul Trio - Beatles Songbook
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T183000
UID:blogto-234327@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/28/original_image2b9f8591-173d-4949-b940-20aaa3fd7c
 13.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Experience hits from the iconic Beatles songbook as you've nev
 er heard them\, presented in a jazz context by the Glenn Paul Trio!\nAfter
  four sold-out shows at Reid's over the last two years\, the trio is excit
