DESCRIPTION:Remember the chaos\, cases\, and high-stakes shifts at The Pit
 t Trivia! Test your knowledge of the ER\, the team\, and every intense mom
 ent.\nWelcome to The Pitt.\nFrom chaotic ER shifts and life-or-death decis
 ions to the team dynamics that keep it all together\, this trivia night di
 ves into the intensity of The Pitt.\nExpect questions on major cases\, cha
 racter arcs\, hospital politics\, and the moments that pushed everyone to 
 their limits.\nAssemble your team\, think fast\, and trust your instincts 
 because in this room\, every answer counts.\nTRIVIA DETAILS\n🕕 Doors op
 en at 6:00 PM. Arrive early\, grab a themed drink\, and get settled in.\n
 ❓ First question at 7:00 PM sharp. Don’t be late.\n🧠 Three rounds o
 f trivia\, about 15 questions each.\n🏆 The top three teams win a Hem’
