 gto.com/events/2026/05/02/original_image4045c1f3-cc2f-41fe-9432-7dc338da05
 4f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This is an invitation to the table that changes everything.\n
 ​An intimate\, curated dinner for women who feel the pull toward somethi
 ng more\, and are ready to step into alignment with what’s next.\n​Thi
 s isn’t just about networking.\nIt’s about being in the right room - s
 urrounded by women who have walked the path\, are walking it\, or are read
 y to.\n​A space where conversations go deeper.\nWhere you don’t have t
 o explain the shift you’re feeling.\nWhere the next version of you start
 s to feel a little more real.\n​Your experience includes a three-course 
 dinner\, a champagne toast\, private dinning and a thoughtfully curated gr
 oup of women\, each navigating their own evolution. You’ll also receive 
 post-event resources\, a strategy call with Laura\, a 1:1 mindset call wit
 h Vanessa and a live private group community call to help you integrate wh
 at opens up in the room.\n​Your hosts\, Vanessa and Laura\, bring a comb
 ined 30 years of professional and inner work experience\, and will guide t
 he space with intention\, depth\, and honesty.\nMay 27\nDinner starts at 7
 PM\nOretta Midtown\nAn investment in Becoming HER:\nThere are a limited nu
 mber of seats available. Get your Ticket to secure your spot!\n​Use prom
 o code "HER" for 15% off until May 11!!\nThat's $200 for a ticket!!\n​Re
 serve your seat and step into the room that’s been calling you.\n​See 
 you at the table - xx Vanessa & Laura
LOCATION:Oretta Midtown
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/becomingher-toronto/
