BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sparks & Sips: Spring Fling - Singles Mixer - Ages: 35-45
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T220000
UID:blogto-234523@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/02/original_image52c72074-6019-4891-9c0e-0f130a899a
 e1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Overview\nHUMRĀ presents an exclusive matchmaking experience
 —refined\, intentional\, and unforgettable. Your next chapter starts wit
 h one introduction.\nTHE EVENING\nThe Lounge at Reid's Distillery in Lesli
 eville. A guest list of professional Toronto singles who are done with the
  apps\, done with the confusion\, and ready to be somewhere that was built
  genuinely and carefully for them.\nHUMRĀ events are not bar nights with 
 a matchmaking label. Every element of this evening has been designed with 
 one question in mind: what does it actually take for two people to feel so
 mething real? The answer\, in our experience\, is never more options. It's
  the right room\, the right conditions\, and a little willingness to show 
 up.\nBEFORE YOU ARRIVE\nOnce you purchase your ticket\, you'll receive a s
 hort compatibility questionnaire. It takes about 10 minutes.\nIn the days 
 leading up to the event\, you'll receive an email letting you know if you 
 have one\, two\, or three top compatibility matches. Names will be reveale
 d at the event.\nWHAT'S INCLUDED\nSix curated compatibility stations inclu
 ding guided cocktail-making\, light snacks\, and an evening designed aroun
 d one thing: letting real chemistry surface on its own terms. Think six mi
 ni dates.\nAnd at a set point during the evening\, every guest discovers t
 heir compatibility matches. The format is part of the experience\, you'll 
 find out when you're there.\nThere is nothing else like it in Toronto.\nTH
 E STATIONS\nGuided Cocktail-Making: Hosted by the resident expert mixologi
 sts. Build something from scratch\, side by side.\nPaint by Prompt: One pr
 ompt. Your interpretation.\nLEGO Botanicals: A slow\, considered build. Ro
 ses\, petal by petal. No competition. Just presence.\nCeramic Pot Painting
 : Something to take home: a hand-painted pot and a packet of flower seeds 
 for planting later.\nJenga Q&A: The questions are already on the blocks.\n
 Conversation Cards: 240 prompts across five categories: things you'd never
  think to ask\, things you assumed you already knew\, and a few that will 
 catch you off guard.\nHOW THE EVENING FLOWS\n7:15 PM → Arrival Doors ope
 n. The music is already on. You don't have to do anything yet except arriv
 e.\n7:30 PM → Doors close. The evening begins. Out of respect for every 
 guest in the room\, we close the doors and begin on time—no exceptions. 
 The opening activity sets the tone for everything that follows\, and we wa
 nt you in it from the start. Please plan to arrive by 7:15 PM.\n7:30 PM 
 → The Icebreaker A lighthearted opening activity to get you moving\, get
  you talking\, and get you out of your head. By the time it's over\, you'l
 l already have someone to explore the rest of the evening with.\nThroughou
 t the evening → Six compatibility stations including guided cocktail-mak
 ing - think of these as mini date stations. Light snacks. Conversation tha
 t actually goes somewhere.\nThe match reveal → At a set point during the
  evening\, every guest discovers their compatibility matches. The format i
 s part of the experience\, you'll find out when you're there.\n10:00 PM Th
 e evening ends. What happens after is up to you.\nWHO THIS IS FOR\nYou've 
 built a life you're proud of. You know what you want in a partner\, not th
 e version of it that looked good on a profile\, but the real version. You'
 ve given the apps a fair shot and gotten a fair amount of nothing in retur
 n.\nThis evening is for you.\nProfessional Toronto singles in the 35–45 
 range\, ready to be in a room where something real might actually happen. 
 We keep the guest list intimate by design\, not because we had to\, but be
 cause we know that's where connection lives.\nOur last event sold out in 7
  days and 95% of guests had a compatible match in the room that night. We 
 don't say that to impress you. We say it so you understand what kind of ev
 ening this is.\nDRESS CODE\nCome dressed for the evening you want to have
 —elevated\, considered\, the outfit you save for somewhere worth going. 
 Smart casual at minimum. The room will match your energy.\nGOOD TO KNOW\nC
 heck-in opens at 7:15 PM. Doors close at 7:30 PM sharp—the opening activ
 ity begins immediately and late entry is not available. Please plan accord
 ingly.\nThe Lounge at Reid's Distillery - 32 Logan Avenue\, Toronto.\nPlea
 se arrive with your phone charged. You may need it during the evening.\nA 
 charcuterie box is available as an add-on at checkout.\nThe 35–45 age ra
 nge is a guideline. Everyone is welcome.\nTickets are non-refundable.\nFul
 l arrival details will be sent to ticket holders by email ahead of the eve
 nt.\nHUMRĀ facilitates introductions and curated experiences. We do not g
 uarantee romantic outcomes.\nABOUT HUMRĀ\nHUMRĀ is a Toronto matchmaking
  collective built on a simple belief: that the right two people\, in the r
 ight room\, find each other.\nWe design experiences—from intimate single
 s evenings to private one-on-one matchmaking—for professionals who take 
 love seriously. Our name comes from the legend of the red string of fate: 
 two souls bound together long before they meet. We believe that. We also b
 elieve destiny benefits from a little help.\nIf tonight is your first HUMR
 Ā experience\, we're glad you're here. It won't be your last.\nhumra.love
  · hello@humra.love\nQuestions? Reach us at hello@humra.love. We respond 
 within 24 hours—always a real person\, never a bot.
LOCATION:Reid's Distillery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/sparks-sips-spring-fling-singles-mixer-a
 ges-35-45-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:THE SOVEREIGN GALA: GENESIS - Toronto Tech Week's Biggest Event! -
  Black Tie\, Masquerade Networking Social/Mixer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T230000
UID:blogto-232481@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/03/21/original_image84019e19-27ec-43a2-9744-fd3ad8b07a
 ab.jpg
DESCRIPTION:About the Event\nTHE SOVEREIGN GALA: GENESIS is not your typic
 al Toronto networking event. This will be the most prestigious event of To
 ronto Tech Week! Prepare for an evening of elegance\, mystery\, and powerf
 ul connections with entrepreneurs\, investors\, founders\, and influential
  leaders.\nWe are Proud to be an Official Partner of Toronto Tech Week.\nS
 et in a luxurious black-tie atmosphere\, this masquerade blends elegance w
 ith connection. A selection of Gourmet food\, and an Open Bar to share con
 versations. Behind the masks\, guests you will meet include some of the mo
 st ambitious minds across Tech\, AI\, Real Estate\, Venture Capital\, and 
 Startups. Expect a refined social environment where meaningful conversatio
 ns\, partnerships\, and new ideas can emerge naturally.\nWhat To Expect\n
 🍽️ Food Experience\nEnjoy elevated food stations throughout the night
 :\n• Oven-Baked Custom Pizza Station – Fresh pizzas made to order• C
 hef-Curated Gourmet Bites served throughout the evening• Artisan Gelato 
 Station with premium flavors• Delicious small plates perfect for minglin
 g and socializing\n🍸 Drinks & Bar\nA premium bar experience designed fo
 r the night:\n• Signature Masquerade Cocktails crafted exclusively for t
 he event• Open Bar with premium spirits\, wine\, and beer• Drinks cura
 ted by professional mixologists\n🎭 Black & Gold Masquerade\nEnter a stu
 nning black-and-gold themed venue where masks and black-tie attire create 
 an atmosphere of elegance and intrigue.The masquerade setting adds mystery
  while making conversations more relaxed and memorable.\n💎 GEMSTONE FIN
 ANCE PRESENTS\n💍 An Exclusive Gemstone Auction\nBrowse and bid in a sil
 ent gemstone auction. featuring a limited collection of unique certified p
 recious gems from the Gemstone Finance vaults. Timeless beauty and value p
 resented in a curated gemstone browsing experience\, and at the end of the
  night\, they can be yours forever. We will be announcing more specifics a
 s we draw closer to the Gala.\n🎟️ WIN a Precious Gemstone\nEvery atte
 ndee will also be entered into a draw to win a Certified Precious Gemstone
  with an appraised value of over $1000! Details to be announced.\n🥂 Lux
 ury Social Atmosphere\nExpect a vibrant environment with great music by by
  Rotation Sensation\, great people\, and meaningful conversations\, all de
 signed to spark new ideas\, partnerships\, and opportunities.\n🚐 Luxury
  Limo Shuttle/Party Bus\nFor a seamless experience\, complimentary limo sh
 uttles will run between Toronto and the venue throughout the night. (Detai
 ls will be shared with approved guests)\nItinerary\n7:00 PM – 7:30 PM | 
 Arrivals & Check-In\nGuests arrive\, check in\, and step into the black an
 d gold masquerade atmosphere.\nLuxury Limo Shuttle/Party Bus Downtown Toro
 nto Pickup Starts at 7:00pm (Details will be shared with approved guests)\
 n7:30 PM – 10:30 PM | Party & Social Experience\nEnjoy the best of Toron
 to Tech Week while enjoying music\, food\, the gemstones on display\, the 
 silent auction and open bar in an elegant setting.\n11:00 PM – 1:00 AM |
  Final Connections & Closing Moments\nExchange contacts\, continue convers
 ations\, and head out to the after parties! (Official Partner After Partie
 s TBD)\nJoin Us on WhatsApp\nBe part of our growing WhatsApp Community! Co
 ntinue the conversations\, share information\, and connect with our growin
 g community by clicking here.\nDress Code:\nAn evening of elegance and mys
 tery. Guests are expected to wear formal black tie attire paired with a ma
 squerade mask.\nGentlemen are expected to wear a tuxedo or black formal su
 it with bow tie.\nLadies are encouraged to wear evening gowns or elegant c
 ocktail dresses.\nMasquerade masks are highly encouraged to embrace the my
 stery and atmosphere of the evening.\nColors that complement the event aes
 thetic:Black\, white\, gold\, metallics\, and deep jewel tones.\n🔞 Age 
 Requirement: 19+\n“Toronto Tech Week is a citywide celebration of the pe
 ople building what’s next. From May 25–29\, 2026\, founders\, investor
 s\, and builders come together for hundreds of community-led events across
  Toronto\, connecting tens of thousands of people around Canadian tech. T
 orontotechweek.com.”\nEVENT SPONSOR:\nTriggerVox - Turn Your Calls and W
 ebsite Into aSales Machine. Acts as your 24/7 Receptionist (Scheduling\, Q
 &A\, Customer Support\, FAQ)\nTriggerVox talks to your leads within 30 sec
 onds\, answers questions\, handles objections\, and books appointments so 
 you never miss a sale/client/Customer!\nWhat to Bring\n✅ Your Mask & Bla
 ck Tie Attire✅ Business Cards or LinkedIn QR Code✅ Friends & Colleague
 s who would enjoy connecting with Toronto’s most ambitious community (Al
 l guests must sign up and be approved)
LOCATION:1377 The Queensway Unit 101\, Toronto\, ON M8Z 1T1
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-sovereign-gala-genesis-toronto-tech-
 weeks-biggest-event-black-tie-masquerade-networking-socialmixer-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
