  this new walking tour! Join Toronto's First Post Office\, in partnership 
 with 183 Gallery Amazing Moss Park\, for a new walking tour that will expl
 ore the history and architecture of Queen Street East in the Old Town neig
 hbourhood.\nMeeting at Toronto's First Post Office\, participants will be 
 shown how the street has changed through carefully curated stops that will
  bring to light the various businesses and historical events that have sha
 ped the Old Town area. The tour will end at 183 Gallery Amazing Moss Park 
 where participants can enjoy the 2026 Contact Photography Festival and enj
 oy some Single Estate English Tea and cookies.\nThe proceeds of this walk 
