 second-ever public fundraising walk — and you're invited!\n\nJoin us on 
 Saturday\, May 30\, 2026\, for a family-friendly walk through downtown Tor
 onto in support of world-class care\, research\, and innovation at Univers
 ity Health Network (UHN). With an option of 5km or 2km\, the accessible ro
 ute passes four UHN hospitals and ends in a celebration at Toronto General
  Hospital with food\, activities\, and live entertainment by Kardinal Offi
 shal and Dwayne Gretzky!\n\nWalk\, fundraise\, and show your support for C
 anada’s #1 Hospital.\n\nRegister now at wewalkuhnited.ca
