 52.jpg
DESCRIPTION:IN FULL BLOOM is an experiential relaxation therapy workshop c
 ombining aromatherapy\, sound therapy and mindfulness-based practices desi
 gned to help you reconnect with your personal energetics and inner vitalit
 y.\nInspired by the natural intelligence of plants - rooted\, nourished\, 
 and reaching toward the light - you are invited to explore what it means t
 o ground yourself and expand your emotional capacity for increased calm\, 
 presence\, and resilience.\nFacilitated by accredited health practitioners
 \, this multi-sensory workshop will combine mind-body practices and tools 
 to enhance your everyday life including aromatherapy\, sound bathing\, voc
 al toning\, mindfulness and wellness education to support emotional balanc
 e and wellbeing.\nJoin us for a unique\, immersive experience and gain ins
 ight into how your body\, mind\, and energy systems interact.\nHealth insu
 rance eligible.
