 the night keeps moving:\n- Scratch & Win cards with prizes ranging from fr
 ee apps (yes\, nachos are in play) to pitchers of beer\n- Giveaways includ
 ing anniversary tees\, hats\, and socks\n- A steady flow of drinks\, food\
 , and energy in a bar that knows how to celebrate properly\nWe’re starti
 ng the party at the door:\nA sampling station on our front patio serving a
 s your first taste of the night\nWe’re building momentum all week at the
  trivia nights leading straight into the main event.\nDoors open at 4pm. T
 he first 40 beers go fast.\nEverything after that? Still worth staying for
 .
