  “Summer Nights\,” “Greased Lightnin’” and “We Go Together\,
 ” Grease celebrates Rydell High’s class of 1959 in all their duck-tail
 ed\, bobby-soxed\, gum-snapping glory.\nNightwood Theatre is proud to pres
 ent one of the most celebrated musicals of all time\, Grease\, as their 20
 26 Lawyer Show. For over a decade\, this annual fundraiser\, has hosted hu
 ndreds of legal professionals as they venture on stage in support of extra
 ordinary Canadian theatre. Every year up to 40 members of the legal commun
 ity rehearse for three months to stage an exhilarating\, entertaining prod
 uction\, led by a team of professional directors\, designers and vocal coa
 ches. Catch this limited run of Grease\, a silent auction\, and 50/50 tick
 ets this June!
LOCATION:St Lawrence Centre for the Arts
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/grease-the-lawyer-show-fundraiser-toront
 o/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
