BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2 nd FLIGHT EXPRESS Wiggly Warehouse Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T040000
UID:blogto-234001@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/22/original_image08e9725c-4c24-45b8-8423-3f5e5db9eb
 75.jpg
DESCRIPTION:WiGGLY Warehouse: SECOND Flight Express\n10pm-4am | 3 Rooms | 
 3 Sounds | ALL ACCESS\nCASH ONLY | ATM on Site\n25 Commercial Rd. - M4G 1Z
 3\nTouch down where history once took off.\nDress the part — aviators\, 
 captains\, flight attendants\, or anything sky-high\nDeep inside a histori
 c warehouse at the forgotten Leaside Aerodrome\, WiGGLY Events transforms 
 an aviation legendary space into a late-night launchpad\, turning a histor
 ic warehouse into a full-throttle dance terminal built for lift-off with n
 o return flight.  This rustic warehouse from the early 1900's served as an
  airplane hangar at what used to be the Leaside airport and has been waiti
 ng for over a century for a proper Wiggly Warehouse party.\nThe more creat
 ive\, the better — uniforms\, goggles\, wings\, badges\, full fantasy…
  we want it ALL.... Boarding soon\, don't miss your flight.\nHouse Room\nT
 AKiN | Tyler Hill | Miz Megs | RandomDoug | Melanie Sutherland\nVJs:  Prab
 insayami | Amir Nian | Lasers by Swimming\nDnb & Jungle Room (Hosted by Ro
