BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Proper Launch Party ft The Freestylers and Smalltown DJs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T040000
UID:blogto-234537@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/02/original_imagee017700d-cef4-4146-8f93-cbc62d2a46
 52.jpg
DESCRIPTION:PROPER is a new Toronto-based production company dedicated to 
 pushing the future sound of Breaks\, House\, and Drum & Bass. Focused on h
 igh-energy dancefloors\, cutting-edge artists\, and immersive late-night e
 xperiences\, PROPER aims to bring a fresh wave of underground electronic m
 usic culture to the city.\nTo celebrate its official launch\, PROPER bring
 s together two iconic acts that embody the spirit of bass-driven dance mus
 ic — the legendary Freestylers and Canada’s own Smalltown DJs — for 
 a night built for movement\, energy\, and pure dancefloor connection.\nPio
 neers of the UK breaks scene\, The Freestylers have been at the forefront 
 of bass music for over two decades. Known for massive anthems and genre-de
 fining releases\, their sound blends breakbeat\, electro\, hip hop\, and r
 ave energy into explosive DJ sets that continue to ignite dancefloors worl
 dwide. From underground clubs to major festivals\, The Freestylers remain 
 a driving force in global electronic music culture.\nHailing from Calgary\
 , Smalltown DJs have built an international reputation for their infectiou
 s blend of house\, techno\, and bass-heavy grooves. With releases on some 
 of the world’s most respected labels and performances across major festi
 vals and clubs\, their dynamic sets seamlessly bridge underground credibil
 ity with peak-time energy\, making them a staple in Canada’s electronic 
 scene and beyond.\nBuilt for the heads who live for the drop\, PROPER is a
 bout more than just parties — it’s about cultivating a forward-thinkin
 g community around breaks\, house\, and drum & bass in Toronto. With a foc
 us on quality sound\, curated lineups\, and unforgettable atmospheres\, PR
 OPER is setting the tone for what’s next.
LOCATION:Wiggle Room
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/proper-launch-party-ft-the-freestylers-a
 nd-smalltown-djs-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
