 he many intersections of the LGBTQ2S+ community.” – IN Magazine\nSatur
 day June 13. Gates 2pm / Show 3pm. The Campbell House Museum Outdoor Garde
 ns. 160 Queen Street West (Near Osgoode Subway Station). Tickets $30.\nCom
 e Join The Funny this Pride!\nACCESSIBILITY\nWhile the outdoor gardens are
