 ed over 500 notable guests\, including politicians\, healthcare profession
 als\, and community leaders.\nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, June 13\, 20
 26\nTime: Doors open at 5:30 PM EST | Program runs from 6:30 PM to 9:30 PM
