 gto.com/events/2026/04/21/original_image255dfb06-a8a3-47ff-823c-105e6f7b46
 a8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Date: Saturday\, June 20\, 2026\nTime: 10:00 am – 4:00 pm\nL
 ocation: Bata Shoe Museum\, 327 Bloor St. W.\nTickets: Included with Gener
 al Admission\nGet ready for a joy-filled Family Pride celebration packed w
 ith colour\, creativity\, and plenty of sparkle! Drop in anytime to enjoy 
 hands-on crafts\, a temporary tattoo station\, a photo booth\, and a museu
 m-wide scavenger hunt that will have folks of any age and identity explori
 ng together.\nAt 1:00 pm\, the highlight of the day will be a one-hour Dra
 g Queen Storytelling and dance-party spectacular led by Toronto drag royal
 ty Lucinda Miu and Guy Anabella. Expect big energy\, fabulous moves\, play
 ful stories\, and lots of chances to dance along as they celebrate self-ex
