 ac.jpg
DESCRIPTION:All About Alocasias: How to Grow (and Keep Alive) These Tropic
 al Showstoppers\nStruggling with Alocasias? You’re not alone. These bold
 \, beautiful tropicals are known for their dramatic leaves and their equal
 ly dramatic care needs. All About Alocasias is an informative\, beginner-f
 riendly seminar designed to help you understand what these plants actually
  want so you can stop guessing and start growing with confidence.\nWe’ll
  break down the key factors that make or break an Alocasia\, from watering
  and light to humidity and dormancy. Whether your plant is dropping leaves
 \, turning yellow\, or just not thriving\, this session will help you get 
 to the root of the issue and bring it back on track.\nFor more details & t
 o sign up\, visit our website! www.angasfarm.ca
LOCATION:Anga's Farm & Nursery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/angas-farm-seminar-all-about-alocasias-p
 lants-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
