BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Strings in Bloom: Canadian Legends
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T220000
UID:blogto-233964@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/21/original_image5da61dd3-80e6-453e-bc6b-1049416294
 2a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Strings in Bloom: Canadian Legends is a one-night-only concert
  at Bellvue Manor on June 26th\, featuring a live octet performing stunnin
 g orchestral renditions of songs by Canada’s most iconic artists — fro
 m Celine Dion to The Tragically Hip\, and beyond.\nBlending classical eleg
 ance with modern nostalgia\, this immersive performance transforms beloved
  hits into powerful\, emotional arrangements that will give you chills fro
 m the first note to the final bow.\nWhether you’re planning a romantic n
 ight out\, a memorable evening with friends\, or simply want to experience
  music in a completely new way — this is a show you won’t want to miss
 .
