 40.jpg
DESCRIPTION:🐾 Calling All Animal Lovers & Pet Parents! 🐾\nJoin us at
  the Party 4 Paws Pet Fair in Toronto for a heartwarming\, tail-wagging ce
 lebration of everything we love about our furry companions.\nHosted at Tri
 nity Bellwoods Park\, this outdoor pet fair brings together passionate ani
 mal lovers\, devoted pet owners\, and dedicated animal rescue groups for a
  weekend full of connection and community.\nThis two-day outdoor pet festi
 val features:\n• Toronto pet vendors\n• Dog treats\, toys & accessorie
 s\n• Local and international animal rescues\n• Adoption information\n
 • Family-friendly activities\n• Dog-friendly outdoor shopping\nWhether
  you’re a proud pet parent\, thinking about adopting\, or simply can’t
  resist stopping to pet every dog you pass\, Party 4 Paws is your kind of 
 crowd.\nBring your leash\, bring your love for animals\, and join us for a
  paws-itively unforgettable weekend!\nFollow us on social media @guardians
 best\n🐾 Calling all vendors & animal rescues! 🐾\nAre you a pet-relat
 ed business\, maker\, service provider\, or animal rescue?\nThis is your c
 hance to connect with thousands of engaged pet lovers\, showcase your work
 \, and be part of a meaningful\, high-energy community event.\nApplication
 s are now open!\nFor more information\, contact us at admin@guardiansbest.
 com
LOCATION:Trinity Bellwoods Park (Dog Bowl)
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/party-4-paws-pet-fair-toronto-7/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
