 cesses.\nThe five-day camp takes full advantage of Gallery 44's extensive 
 production facilities\, set within the 401 Richmond arts building\, a vibr
 ant hub home to a dynamic arts community of artist studios\, festivals and
  galleries.\nParticipants will:\nEXPLORE the city with a camera\nTRANSFORM
  an idea into a photograph\nCREATE photos with a manual 35 mm film camera 
