 Totally original... Funky as all hell... this ain’t any Kenny G oatmeal 
 for folks with no teeth."\n- Mike Greenblatt\, Classicalite (New York\, US
 A)\n----\nUnder the leadership of JUNO-nominated and 10x Global Music Awar
 d–winning jazz pianist NICK MACLEAN\, SNAGGLE feat the ALI BROS launches
  into a daring new chapter: a suite of electrifying works inspired by the 
 science fiction grandmaster ISAAC ASIMOV and his legendary FOUNDATION saga
 . Often described as “Canada’s answer to Snarky Puppy”\, the band go
 es interstellar using their fearless sound\, likened to a cross between el
 ectric-era Miles Davis and Rage Against the Machine\, to map the rise and 
 fall of galactic empires.\nFront and center are the ALI BROS\, the near-te
 lepathic horn duo of BROWNMAN ALI (Guru\, Jay-Z\, Randy Brecker) on trumpe
 t and MARCUS ALI (Matt Dusk\, Jason Wilson\, Mr Something Something) on sa
 xophone. Like Asimov’s psychohistorians\, they shape the future with eve
 ry phrase\, weaving complex probabilities into sonic reality. Joining them
  on this voyage are some of Toronto’s finest electric-jazz explorers: JA
 Y YOO on guitar\, PHIL ALBERT on bass\, and ADAM MANSFIELD on drums.\nWith
  performances swinging from Seldon–like moments of quiet\, calculated cl
 arity to cataclysmic bursts of energy worthy of a crumbling empire... Snag
 gle’s new repertoire doesn’t just pay homage to ASIMOV\, it channels t
 he spirit of his storytelling: daring\, complex\, and endlessly imaginativ
 e. For fans of Jazz\, Science Fiction\, and the BOUNDLESS possibilities th
 at emerge when the two intertwine... this is a voyage not to be missed!\n-
 ---\n:: Nick Maclean - keys/synth\n:: Brownman Ali - electric trumpet\n:: 
 Marcus Ali - tenor sax\n:: Jay Yoo - guitar\n:: Phil Albert - bass\n:: Ada
 m Mansfield - drums\n----\nWATCH Snaggle perform at the 2022 TU Jazz Festi
 val\nhttps://youtu.be/ggp8lHRB_RA?si=iu0j9NZ2hIB_7fbo\nLISTEN to Snaggle's
  uptempo burner 'THEORUM'\, from THE LONG SLOG\nhttps://youtu.be/YlHVbRgPY
 Nk?si=bq_CkJUweRj81s_Y\nLISTEN to Snaggle's twisted odyssey 'SAW'\, from T
 HE LONG SLOG\nhttps://youtu.be/ai2sYhw-SYc?si=EafC2ZIsd3RxYZP6\nLISTEN to 
 Snaggle's eclectic holiday single 'CHRISTMAS TUNE'\nhttps://youtu.be/RRf8U
 8cETZc?si=wfAZbOj3a5HPCd1l\n----\nFor more info:\nwww.NickMacleanJazz.com\
 nwww.Maclean.Browntasauras.com\nwww.Brownman.com\nwww.Browntasauras.com\n=
 ================================\nALL TOUR DATES\nThr-Jul-09 @ Henry's On 
 James\, Hamilton\nFri-Jul-10 @ My House\, Toronto\nSat-Jul-11 @ Lakefield 
 Jazz Festival\, Lakefield\nSun-Jul-12 @ The George Whiskey Lounge\, Newmar
 ket\nAll Tickets Available @ www.Maclean.Browntasauras.com
LOCATION:My House
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/nick-macleans-snaggle-feat-the-ali-bros-
 an-asimov-inspired-jazz-funk-journey-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
