DESCRIPTION:Free Admission | Free Parking\nSaturday\, July 25\, 2026 10am-
 5pm\nSunday\, July 26\, 2026 10am-5pm\nThe Guild Alive with Culture Arts F
 estival is a vibrant\, family-friendly outdoor event held annually at the 
 scenic Guild Park & Gardens. Celebrating its rich history and connection t
 o the arts\, the festival brings together over 100 local and regional arti
 sts\, artisans\, musicians\, performers\, and food vendors for a weekend o
 f creativity\, culture\, and community.\nSet against the stunning backdrop
  of historic sculptures and nature trails\, the festival offers a unique o
 pportunity for visitors to explore original art\, shop handcrafted goods\,
  enjoy live entertainment\, and participate in interactive workshops and a
 ctivities for all ages.\nWith strong community roots and a growing reputat
 ion\, the Guild Alive Festival is a must-attend summer event that highligh
 ts Scarborough’s cultural spirit and supports local talent and small bus
 inesses.
LOCATION:GUILD PARK AND GARDENS
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/guild-alive-with-culture-art-festival-to
 ronto/
